---
const appName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_NAME || 'CAZAMI Access';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#151321"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><title>{appName}</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%,#58356772,transparent 50%),#14111d;color:#f8f2ff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.card{border:1px solid #ffffff20;background:#ffffff0a;border-radius:27px;padding:clamp(30px,6vw,70px);max-width:730px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 30px 100px #0006}.tag{display:inline-block;color:#d5ade9;border:1px solid #d5ade966;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:30px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:800}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,8vw,72px);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1.05;margin:25px 0}h1 span{color:#ddb1ee}p{color:#bfb6ca;line-height:1.8;font-size:17px;max-width:510px;margin:0 auto 32px}a{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:#d2aae9;color:#25152f;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 29px;min-height:48px;border-radius:13px;font-weight:800}footer{color:#8f849e;font-size:12px;margin-top:35px}
</style>
</head>
<body><main class="card"><span class="tag">CAZAMI STUDIO · ACCESS</span><h1>Una entrada.<br/><span>Mil momentos.</span></h1><p>Administra eventos, folios y sus invitaciones digitales desde cualquier dispositivo.</p><a href="/admin">Entrar al panel administrativo →</a><footer>© {new Date().getFullYear()} CAZAMI Studio · Plataforma en desarrollo</footer></main></body>
</html>